Murage Windows no-console patch (0.36.0-omb.3). Apply after agent-browser-windows-stdio.patch and murage-control-token.fix1.patch.
The daemon is DETACHED_PROCESS (no console), so each console-subsystem child it spawns (chrome-headless-shell.exe,
ffmpeg, aws, this executable) opened a visible console window. Every such spawn now passes CREATE_NO_WINDOW (Windows only).
